"""
WHY GOLD IS GOLD — relativity inside an atom (Blender 4.2+ / 5.x)   @AlexCarten_

Gold has 79 protons, so its inner electrons move at about Z*alpha = 79/137 = 58% of the speed of light.
At that speed they are ~22% heavier (gamma = 1.22), the 6s orbital contracts by ~17%, the 5d->6s gap
drops from ~3.7 eV (silver: ultraviolet) to ~2.4 eV (gold: blue). Gold absorbs blue, reflects yellow.

Clouds: hydrogen-like radial shapes (6s, 5d, core), sampled from |psi|^2 — an illustration of the real effect.

File > New > General -> Scripting -> Open -> Run Script -> Ctrl+F12
Video: ~/OrbitalRenders/gold/gold.mp4   (music: gold_music.wav, same timing — drop it in CapCut at 0)
No Python runs during playback/render (baked keyframes + geometry nodes).
"""
